{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not delay JVM-fatal failures behind arbitrary cleanup.** After an end hook throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, this loop continues through remaining plugins; any subsequent hook can block indefinitely and prevent the fatal condition from escaping. Rethrow JVM-fatal errors immediately, or strictly time-bound any best-effort cleanup.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772RGm","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":114,"observation_digest":"a01afea0e934a23065fa9886bc59eb3b3fb7b4845375ad74178d816f5b529551","observation_id":"aro_v1_uanp5ihjgsrdazp2tcdlywplhm","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-08T23:52:39Z","review_id":"arr_v1_szk72x3mjnb5bveole7xlq3ka3","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"a14e96e22281887b621451a5488a88d7de1a49ff","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_ys6atmry2jfx6jfsmyavn6qnyq","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T23:52:39Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
